{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S10-1\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"“两头都舍不得”和“怕逼人”的顾虑都能从前文承接，“先留着”表达的是允许矛盾心思共存，没有新增人物、往事、场景或真实动作。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S10-2\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"委屈和渴望的松动、身体变轻及暂时喘息都与珠子的体验相符，没有把音乐变化当作心理原因，也没有把比喻写成真实事件。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"links\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S09-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S10-1\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S09-3已经写明两头都舍不得、越想越委屈也越累，这直接解释了他为何暂时撤掉必须立即选择的要求。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"不看珠子也能读懂从不愿二选一到允许两种心思共存、情绪随之松动的过程，暂时缓解但尚未解决的关系也交代清楚了。\",\n  \"lost\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\n        \"R45\"\n      ],\n      \"what\": \"“带着盼望喜欢，也坦承自己没有把握”的明确态度没有完整保留；“不是答案”只说明问题暂时未解，没有明确写出他愿意带着盼望继续喜欢，并承认自己仍然不确定。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"unexplained\": [],\n  \"wordy\": [\n    {\n      \"ids\": [\n        \"S10-1\"\n      ],\n      \"why\": \"开头“两头都舍不得”原样重复了紧邻的 S09-3，后半句又把两头展开为“想靠近的心和怕逼人的顾虑”；跨段箭头已经承接前因，可以删去开头这处重复。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "7d5e3d3f-4c3e-412a-8f2e-7bc462814b58", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T063458591000Z", "elapsed_seconds": 240.812, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T06:38:59.422087+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "402f8affcf7a7ba7a34cdca3d849037458982a0c5da797ce33eca531bd567db1", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": 